        <mxCell id="text_L07_right" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14.5px;color:#1a365d;&quot;&gt;Five Drone Missions &amp; Governed Flight Operations&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2b6cb0;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[ADR-002 / A15 (Drone Service §5.2)]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;All 5 missions preserved under combined flight mode (contracted operator, ASM-141).&lt;br&gt;Governed by agronomist MFA authorization and S3 flight record audit.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1">
