        <mxCell id="text_L11_right" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14.5px;color:#7b341e;&quot;&gt;Segmented LAN (7 VLANs) &amp; Dual IPsec VPN to AWS Transit Gateway&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#c05621;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[A11 / A07 (Collection-Center Network) | B05]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Standardized center pattern: 7 isolated VLANs (101-120), edge firewall (10.4x.20.1), dual IPsec tunnels&lt;br&gt;over 100 Mbps broadband + cellular backup to Transit Gateway hub (ASM-083, B05).&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1920" y="1447" width="1024" height="74" as="geometry" />
