        <mxCell id="text_L12_right" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14.5px;color:#7b341e;&quot;&gt;Zero Federation Infrastructure at Port | Commercial Mobile Outbox&lt;/b&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#c05621;font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;[A10 / A16 (Connectivity §10)]&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.5px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Zero Federation hardware deployed in Buenaventura (case statement mandate). Transporter app&lt;br&gt;records maritime delivery &amp; custody handoff; encrypted outbox syncs via mobile carrier.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=5;" vertex="1">
