        <mxCell id="reason_L13" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13.5px;color:#9b2c2c;&quot;&gt;Reason for Retirement: Mobile Access Generation Sunset (ASM-041, ASM-072)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Dependence on a mobile access network generation switched off before or during the pilot (ASM-041). The case statement names no generation (ASM-041); pure IP bearer without generation dependency is enforced.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;html=1;" vertex="1">
