        <mxCell id="reason_L18" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:13.5px;color:#9b2c2c;&quot;&gt;Reason for Retirement: Case Statement Mandate: No Inherited Design Manual (Epic 7, PD-154)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#2d3748;&quot;&gt;Case statement mandates: &quot;No se hereda un manual de 2020&quot; (p. 7). Challenge Point 7 establishes a new design system with 4 standardized badges for the 7 sack lifecycle states.&lt;/span&gt;" parent="1" style="rounded=1;arcSize=2;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#e2e8f0;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;html=1;" vertex="1">
